"200" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dr-story" value="Warm standby region with explicit service-by-service recovery" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#0f172a" vertex="1" parent="dr"><mxGeometry x="35" y="570" width="190" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note-what" value="&lt;b&gt;Business story&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;One governed AI gateway controls user access, policy, and observability across chat and ingestion workloads." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#93c5fd;fontColor=#1e3a8a" vertex="1" parent="notes"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="230" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note-risk" value="&lt;b&gt;Risk reduction&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Private endpoints, controlled DNS, secrets management, and centralized monitoring reduce security and operational risk." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#86efac;fontColor=#166534" vertex="1" parent="notes"><mxGeometry x="20" y="230" width="230" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note-dr" value="&lt;b&gt;Resilience truth&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Failover is not identical for every service. Gateway, compute, SQL, Cosmos, Storage, and AI services each have explicit recovery semantics." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#d8b4fe;fontColor=#6b21a8" vertex="1" parent="notes"><mxGeometry x="20" y="390" width="230" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note-decisions" value="&lt;b&gt;Leadership decisions&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Confirm global ingress pattern, APIM regional model, AKS DR model, and service-specific DR commitments before sign-off." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSiz